---
import MainLayout from "../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Opening of New Production Facility | Justin Ho">
  <a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>

  <section class="project-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Corporate Event / Same-Day Edit</p>
    <h1>Opening of New Production Facility</h1>
    <p class="client">Client: Stahl</p>
  </section>


<section class="video-section">
  <iframe
    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1213525917"
    frameborder="0"
    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture"
    allowfullscreen>
  </iframe>
</section>

  <section class="project-details">
    <h2>Project Overview</h2>
<p>
Produced the same-day edit for the opening of a new production facility for a Dutch industrial company in Singapore. The event was filmed throughout the day, with the finished video premiered during the evening gala dinner.
</p>
<p>
Working under an extremely tight turnaround, I coordinated camera coverage on-site while editing footage in real time, ensuring key moments were captured, assembled and delivered within hours. The project required rapid editorial decision-making, close collaboration with the production team and a polished final film under live event conditions.
</p>


<h2>Role</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Offline Editing</li>
  <li>Same-Day Edit</li>
  <li>Story Development</li>
  <li>Camera Direction &amp; Coverage Coordination</li>
  <li>Colour Correction</li>
  <li>Audio Finishing</li>
  <li>Final Delivery</li>
</ul>


<h2>The Challenge</h2>
<p>
The client required a professionally edited highlight film to be screened during the gala dinner on the same day as the event. With only a few hours between filming and presentation, the production demanded efficient coordination between camera operators and the edit suite while maintaining broadcast-quality standards under significant time pressure.
</p>

  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .back-link {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .project-hero {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 64px 0 40px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .client {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

    h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 16px 0;
    }

  .hero-image {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  .project-details {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .video-section {
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.video-section iframe {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 16px;
}
</style>
